  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: regex trie 16-bit next-offset overflow (GH#23388)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-13221.patch: do not build a trie when the\n       branch-to-tail delta would overflow the 16-bit next-offset field in\n       S_study_chunk() in regcomp.c\n     - CVE-2026-13221\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow in pack/unpack structure sizing (S_measure_struct); a large repeat count wraps the signed size negative, leading to an out-of-bounds heap read\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-57432.patch: integer overflow in pack/unpack structure sizing (S_measure_struct); a large repeat count wraps the signed size negative, leading to an out-of-bounds heap read\n     - CVE-2026-57432",
